<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Line"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:33.280"><div begin="00:19.070" end="02:33.280"><p begin="00:19.070" end="00:22.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I don't wanna play no games with you</p><p begin="00:22.490" end="00:24.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">It's something that I can't do</p><p begin="00:24.080" end="00:26.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Yeah, you lookin' mighty fine</p><p begin="00:26.250" end="00:27.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Just looking at the time</p><p begin="00:27.450" end="00:29.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Just wishin' I could take back time</p><p begin="00:29.080" end="00:32.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Let me know and I'ma pull up (pullin' up)</p><p begin="00:32.280" end="00:34.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">What's your number? Let me call up (call it up)</p><p begin="00:34.750" end="00:37.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Shawty, let me show you what's up (show you what's up)</p><p begin="00:37.390" end="00:39.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Get the dough, Breadwinner (Breadwinner)</p><p begin="00:39.840" end="00:42.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Let me tell you, I got options (options)</p><p begin="00:42.480" end="00:45.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Little baby, I am not them (not them)</p><p begin="00:45.120" end="00:47.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">We don't wanna waste your time</p><p begin="00:47.090" end="00:48.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Makin' you mine</p><p begin="00:48.350" end="00:50.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Baby, you just look so fine</p><p begin="00:50.780" end="00:53.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I'm gonna drip, drip, splash all up in the pool</p><p begin="00:53.280" end="00:55.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">I want you, you, and her, and them pictures too (you, you, and her)</p><p begin="00:55.930" end="00:58.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">8K on the wrist with Balenci' shoes</p><p begin="00:58.510" end="01:01.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I'm a young fly boy, what you gonna do? (Young fly boy)</p><p begin="01:01.750" end="01:06.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">She got her eyes on me but I got my eyes on you</p><p begin="01:06.740" end="01:10.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">She lookin' for money but she do not have a clue</p><p begin="01:10.690" end="01:13.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Let me know and I'ma pull up (pullin' up)</p><p begin="01:13.040" end="01:15.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">What's your number? Let me call up (call it up)</p><p begin="01:15.550" end="01:18.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Shawty, let me show you what's up (show you what's up)</p><p begin="01:18.170" end="01:20.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Get the dough, Breadwinner (Breadwinner)</p><p begin="01:20.750" end="01:23.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Let me tell you, I got options (options)</p><p begin="01:23.410" end="01:26.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Little baby, I am not them (not them)</p><p begin="01:26.010" end="01:27.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">We don't wanna waste your time</p><p begin="01:27.910" end="01:29.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Makin' you mine</p><p begin="01:29.180" end="01:31.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Baby, you just look so fine</p><p begin="01:31.080" end="01:33.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Baby, you look so fine, want to make you mine</p><p begin="01:33.750" end="01:36.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Lookin' at the time, tryna press that rewind, baby</p><p begin="01:36.560" end="01:39.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">I just wanna pull through, maybe break some ground</p><p begin="01:39.060" end="01:42.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">We ain't got no redos, so let's make it count, baby</p><p begin="01:42.640" end="01:44.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">But we only gettin' older</p><p begin="01:44.490" end="01:46.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Wanna be your sweater, rock you when you're colder</p><p begin="01:46.600" end="01:49.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Do this for your pleasure when you're under weather</p><p begin="01:49.320" end="01:51.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Lil' babygirl, you know that you're my treasure</p><p begin="01:51.660" end="01:52.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">(I'm sayin', ****!)</p><p begin="01:52.720" end="01:54.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Yeah, I'm rockin' with my bows</p><p begin="01:54.690" end="01:57.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">And I see your body rockin' with the flow, yeah</p><p begin="01:57.980" end="01:59.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">All them problems gotta go, yeah</p><p begin="01:59.890" end="02:01.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">All them baby little problems, ain't no mo' of them</p><p begin="02:01.790" end="02:04.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">I don't wanna play no games with you</p><p begin="02:04.450" end="02:06.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">It's something that I can't do</p><p begin="02:06.820" end="02:08.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Yeah, you lookin' mighty fine</p><p begin="02:08.360" end="02:09.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Just looking at the time</p><p begin="02:09.520" end="02:11.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Just wishin' I could take back time</p><p begin="02:11.940" end="02:14.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Let me know and I'ma pull up (pullin' up)</p><p begin="02:14.460" end="02:16.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">What's your number? Let me call up (call it up)</p><p begin="02:16.760" end="02:19.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Shawty, let me show you what's up (show you what's up)</p><p begin="02:19.460" end="02:21.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">Get the dough, Breadwinner (Breadwinner)</p><p begin="02:21.930" end="02:24.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">Let me tell you, I got options (options)</p><p begin="02:24.580" end="02:27.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">Little baby, I am not them (not them)</p><p begin="02:27.300" end="02:29.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">We don't wanna waste your time</p><p begin="02:29.180" end="02:30.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">Makin' you mine</p><p begin="02:30.510" end="02:33.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">Baby, you just look so fine</p></div></body></tt>